0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\nv4.7.1.rc1.official [17e2686e0]\nv4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n\nNot reproducible in:\nv4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.rc1 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - GeForce GTX 550 Ti - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads) - 11.95 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe current scene tab remains selected, but the scene panel and the viewport show the last scene tab's contents, when trying to open a .gltf node's scene in the editor.\n\n<img width=\"1028\" height=\"634\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd09a565-9f53-4701-a148-bced2d3fe1a4\" />\n\n<img width=\"1028\" height=\"634\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f74b6d7-9dfd-4f51-ab84-473f636abb65\" />\n\n<img width=\"1028\" height=\"634\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f6a92c6-0aed-4a65-a31f-969e30240555\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the project: [pre-click-scene-tab-selected,-but-last-scene-tab-shown.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29671887/pre-click-scene-tab-selected.-but-last-scene-tab-shown.zip)\n- In the filesystem panel, double-click open the two scenes: one, two\n- On the scene tab bar, select scene: one\n- In the scene panel, click on the Box node's 'Open in Editor' button\n\nA dialog opens:\n> Please Confirm...\n> Scene 'box.gltf' was automatically imported, so it can't be modified.\n> To make changes to it, a new inherited scene can be created.\n\nIssue:\nThe scene panel and the viewport show the last scene 'two', even though scene 'one' is selected in the tab bar.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7fa6349-8aed-4868-ba6c-df65183da675\n\nExpected:\nDon't change scenes. This is how it works in v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n\nIn 4.7, it doesn't change scenes if the last scene tab is a new empty unsaved scene, but it seems to have been stopped by an error, because the Output panel shows:\n>   ERROR: editor/editor_node.cpp:4985 - Parameter \"new_scene\" is null.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c84a725d-cf0d-410a-b932-c9bad454ecb1\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[pre-click-scene-tab-selected,-but-last-scene-tab-shown.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29671887/pre-click-scene-tab-selected.-but-last-scene-tab-shown.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120957/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120957/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}